  "text": "proprium.dedicatio-archibasilicae-sanctissimi-salvatoris-tractus",
  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Dedication of the Archbasilica of the Most Holy Savior” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "This place was made by God, a priceless mystery; it is without reproof. O God, before Whom stands the choir of angels, give ear to the prayers of Your servants. They who trust in the Lord are like Mount Sinai, which is immovable; which forever stands. Mountains are round about Jerusalem; so the Lord is round about His people, both now and forever." }
